<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" style="background-color: #09090B;">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login - Truvex</title>

    <!-- Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Epilogue:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,300&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --green: #00C278;
            --green-glow: rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.4);
            --dark-bg: #09090B;
            --dark-surf: #111116;
            --text-main: #E4E3DF;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Split Screen Layout */
        .login-split {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .login-left {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px;
            position: relative;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.05) 0%, var(--dark-bg) 70%);
        }

        .login-right {
            flex: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050506 0%, #111116 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 80px;
            position: relative;
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .login-right { display: none; }
        }

        /* Ambient Glow in Right Panel */
        .glow-orb {
            position: absolute;
            width: 600px;
            height: 600px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--green-glow) 0%, transparent 60%);
            top: -200px;
            right: -200px;
            filter: blur(80px);
            opacity: 0.5;
            animation: pulse 8s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0); opacity: 0.3; }
            100% { transform: scale(1.1) translate(-20px, 20px); opacity: 0.6; }
        }

        /* Right Panel Content */
        .right-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        .right-content h2 {
            font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #FFF;
        }

        .right-content h2 span {
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .right-content p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #A1A1AA;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* CSS Grid Graphic Mockup */
        .mockup-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .mockup-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            height: 80px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .mockup-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--green);
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        /* Login Card (Left Panel) */
        .login-card {
            background: rgba(17, 17, 22, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .brand {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 32px;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        .brand span {
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .login-header {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .login-header h1 {
            font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: #FFF;
        }

        .login-header p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #A1A1AA;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .form-label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #A1A1AA;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-wrapper i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: #52525E;
            font-size: 20px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px 14px 48px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 15px;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
        
        .form-input::placeholder {
            color: #52525E;
        }

        .form-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--green);
            background: rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.1);
        }

        .form-input:focus + i, .form-input:focus ~ i {
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .btn-login {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--green);
            color: #000000;
            padding: 16px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            background-color: #00E5A0;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 194, 120, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-login:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .error-msg {
            background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            color: #ff6b6b;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        /* Interactive Particles (simulate with CSS) */
        .particle {
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--green);
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.3;
            animation: float 10s infinite linear;
        }
        .p1 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 20%; left: 10%; animation-duration: 15s; }
        .p2 { width: 6px; height: 6px; top: 70%; left: 80%; animation-duration: 25s; }
        .p3 { width: 3px; height: 3px; top: 40%; left: 60%; animation-duration: 20s; }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-100px) translateX(20px); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-split">
        <div class="login-left">
            <div class="particle p1"></div>
            <div class="particle p2"></div>
            <div class="particle p3"></div>
            <%- body %>
        </div>
        <div class="login-right">
            <div class="glow-orb"></div>
            <div class="right-content">
                <h2>O sistema operacional da sua <span>frota.</span></h2>
                <p>Acesse o Truvex e transforme dados complexos em decisões de negócio claras e lucrativas, com monitoramento em tempo real.</p>
                <div class="mockup-grid">
                    <div class="mockup-card"></div>
                    <div class="mockup-card" style="opacity: 0.6"></div>
                    <div class="mockup-card" style="opacity: 0.3"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>